    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "I See Myself"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From silent protests and secret ponderings to vocal uprisings and drastic acts, watch people endeavour to carve a bigger space for themselves in a world that’s trying to box them in."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/fareye-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Altered States"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Fractured memories and uncertain fates are examined in shorts featuring our unshakeable resolve."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/fantasies-of-a-rescue-dummy-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Life / Drawing"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A selection of animated shorts exploring what connects us to people, the world around us and, most importantly, ourselves."
    }
